<label>Email</label><input id="email" placeholder="riya@college.com">
<button class="bg1" onclick="addStudent()">➕ ADD STUDENT - BADA OUTPUT AAYEGA (500+ Lines Output)</button>
<button class="bg2" onclick="markPass()">✅ MARK AS PASS - OUTPUT</button>
<button class="bg3" onclick="markFail()">❌ MARK AS FAIL - OUTPUT</button>
<button class="bg4" onclick="searchStudent()">🔍 SEARCH STUDENT - OUTPUT</button>
<button class="bg5" onclick="deleteStudent()">🗑️ DELETE - OUTPUT</button>
<div id="output" class="out">> ============================================
> STUDENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - BADA CODE
